{"title": "[情報] MB:76人下半場快攻17分我們卻像在泥地跑", "author": "yniori (偉恩咖肥)", "board": "", "date": "Wed Oct 21 13:05:02 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1792559105.A.487.html", "body": "https://x.com/NBA_NewYork/status/2112731711901401334\n\n\"What an ugly game…give Sixers a lot of credit…It looked like we were running\nin mud…Not good getting to our spots, putting pressure…Sixers 17 fastbreak poi\nnts 2d half…we had 15 turnovers for 22 points…Spacing wasn't great, we were wa\nlking everywhere––and when we did get to the paint we couldn't finish…7 spray\ns tonight, we want 20…Hit the paint, play off of 2 feet, finish strong, or spra\nying…You can't shoot 42% in paint while you're turning ball over, getting beat\nin transition. (But) there are things we can & will clean up…Tough ballgame for\n me to watch…We'll be better…Fantastic job all with the ceremony…Thank you\"\n\n    ––    Mike Brown opening monologue as defending champion Knicks lose 106-1\n00 to start season 0-1\n\n 作為衛冕冠軍的第一場比賽以輸球告終，總教練麥克布朗表示：\n\n「我們打的太難看了……要給76人很多讚譽……我們看起來像是在泥地裡跑步，跑位不好…\n…76人在下半場快攻得了17分，我們有15次失誤掉了22分……空間非常差，我們到處走來走\n去我們到了油漆區卻不能終結……只有7次內外傳導，我們想要20次……攻擊油漆區，雙腳\n起跳來處理球，強力終結或內外傳導……你不能在油漆區只有42%命中率的情況下還頻頻失\n誤，在轉換中被打爆。但有些是我們能做到且會處理好……對我來說這場比賽打的很難看…\n…我們會更好，在頒獎儀式上大家都做到很好，謝謝。」\n\n尼克輸在被快攻跟轉換進攻打爆\n76人跑起來~", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "nt880245", "content": "抓猛的鍋 卡禁區", "time": "10/21 13:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "chrisman", "content": "畢竟有四個人可以跑快攻", "time": "10/21 13:07"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "kiolp", "content": "去年快攻前二都在76了 還有JB VJ運動能力爆炸的側翼", "time": "10/21 13:08"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ntusimmon", "content": "快攻不是很簡單嗎？ 尼克幹嘛不跑起來 ？ 陣容有很", "time": "10/21 13:10"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "ntusimmon", "content": "老嗎？", "time": "10/21 13:10"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ljk476820", "content": "…真的好多…", "time": "10/21 13:11"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "tsai529", "content": "今年東區不像去年那麼爽了 加油吧", "time": "10/21 13:11"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "csy0922", "content": "快攻都是簡單分 進攻5打4怎麼打不進去呢", "time": "10/21 13:11"}, {